OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 24 APR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker concludes her
OL,6,     Gweek of specially recorded
OL,7,     Gperformances of fairy tales music
OL,8,     Gwith works inspired by the tales
OL,9,     Gof A Thousand and One Nights.
OL,10,G1600FComposer of the Week: Haydn
OL,11,     GDonald Macleod explores how Haydn
OL,12,     Ggrew frustrated at his life in
OL,13,     GEsterhaza and discovers how he
OL,14,     Gcame to leave the service of the
OL,15,     GEsterhazy family.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GHugo Ticciati plays live with
OL,18,     Gviolinist Linda Suolahti.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Gfavourites.
